flowchart TB
  subgraph Native[Experimental FiltersAPI]
    Read[Native reading and serialization]
    Facts[Privileged observations]
    Tokens[Session tokens and write validation]
    Edit[Native edits and save rollback]
  end
  subgraph MX[MailExtension layer]
    Coordinator[Background job and usage coordinator]
    Analyze[scripts/filter-analysis: portable rules and collation]
    UI[Extension page: localization, reports and confirmation]
  end
  Read -->|Shared backup entity core| Coordinator
  Facts -->|Structured facts and inspection failures| Coordinator
