  Coordinator --> Tokens
  Tokens --> Edit
  Edit -->|Refresh affected snapshot| Read
  Backup[Existing backup files] --> Adapter[Backup adapter: runtime facts unknown]
  Adapter --> Analyze
  Future[Future standard filters API] -.->|Replace native acquisition adapter when available| Coordinator
